  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{精|せい} (detailed, precise) + {査|さ} (examine, investigate)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {精査|せいさ}を{行|おこな}う - to conduct a close examination\n- {精査|せいさ}が{必要|ひつよう} - thorough examination is needed\n- {精査|せいさ}の{結果|けっか} - as a result of close examination\n- {精査|せいさ}{中|ちゅう} - under examination\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {検討|けんとう} - consideration, review (more general)\n- {調査|ちょうさ} - investigation, survey (broader scope)\n- {吟味|ぎんみ} - scrutiny, careful selection\n- {審査|しんさ} - examination, screening (often for approval)\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal. Common in business, academic, and government contexts.",
